stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> BOOT
  BOOT --> SELF_TEST
  SELF_TEST --> DISARMED: checks pass
  SELF_TEST --> FAULT_LATCHED: blocking error
  DISARMED --> ARM_CHECK: fresh owner + explicit arm edge
  ARM_CHECK --> DISARMED: guard not met / switch removed
  ARM_CHECK --> GROUND_ARMED: qualification stable
  GROUND_ARMED --> ACTUATION_ACTIVE: validated demand
  ACTUATION_ACTIVE --> GROUND_ARMED: validated idle command
  GROUND_ARMED --> CONTINGENCY: fault requiring context policy
  ACTUATION_ACTIVE --> CONTINGENCY: fault requiring context policy
  CONTINGENCY --> FAULT_LATCHED: policy escalates or hardware danger
  CONTINGENCY --> DISARMED: explicit ack + all recovery guards
  FAULT_LATCHED --> DISARMED: explicit ack + healthy + guarded context
  GROUND_ARMED --> DISARMED: approved grounded disarm
  note right of ACTUATION_ACTIVE
    Actuator activity is NOT proof
    that aircraft is airborne
  end note
  note right of CONTINGENCY
    In-flight physical response TBD
    No generic servo power cut
  end note
